1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,010
(Zack:)So, long story short,
I nailed her.

2
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:10,180
(Sheldon:)When he finished,
he shouted "Eureka!"

3
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:12,180
No, I always shout, "Holy moly!"

4
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:16,390
(Sheldon:)Don't know why.
Just do.

5
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:19,710
(Sheldon:)All right, that concludes

6
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:22,030
the "getting to know you"
portion of the evening.

7
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:24,910
(Sheldon:)Who's ready to play some
vintage video games?

8
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:26,700
(Sheldon:)And tonight's selections include

9
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,220
ColecoVision's "Smurf Rescue
in Gargamel's Castle,"

10
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,390
Atari's "Cookie Monster Munch,"

11
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:35,210
(Sheldon:)and for you
text adventure aficionados,

12
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:37,610
"Zork."

13
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:41,510
(in high voice):
Pick me, pick me. I'm fun.

14
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:46,430
(Barry:)That all sucks
the big hairy meatball.

15
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:47,490
(Barry:)How about I go get

16
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:49,150
the karaoke machine
out of my car,

17
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:51,990
(Barry:)get plastered and blow
the roof off this place?

18
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:53,330
(Zack:)Great, I'll make a beer run.

19
00:00:53,330 --> 00:00:54,960
(Stuart:)And I'll take a shower.

20
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,230
We'll meet back here in 15.

21
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:57,900
(Amy(on phone):)Check.

22
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:02,020
(door closes)

